<title>GERMANY: German farm ministry sees higher 1997 grain area.</title>
<headline>German farm ministry sees higher 1997 grain area.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain plantings in 1997 are estimated to amount to 7.1 million hectares, up nearly six percent from 1996, the Bonn agriculture ministry said in a weekly circular.</p>
<p>It cited farmers' replies to an official survey.</p>
</text>
